# Build output and caches
_site/
resources/
.cache/
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# Hugo templates: `.html` here is Go template syntax, which Prettier's HTML parser cannot read.
*.html

# Markdown is owned by markdownlint (`npm run test-markdownlint`); running both would
# mean two tools reformatting the same posts.
*.md

# SCSS is owned by stylelint-config-twbs-bootstrap (`npm run test-stylelint`), which disagrees
# with Prettier on quotes and leading zeros. One owner per file type.
*.scss
